# 🛡️ GODADDY HOSTING SECURITY CONFIGURATION

## .htaccess File for Production Security

```apache
# ==========================================
# SECURITY CONFIGURATION FOR GARTHPUCKERIN.COM
# ==========================================

RewriteEngine On

# ==========================================
# FORCE HTTPS/SSL
# ==========================================
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}%{REQUEST_URI} [L,R=301]

# ==========================================
# SECURITY HEADERS
# ==========================================

# Prevent MIME type sniffing
Header always set X-Content-Type-Options nosniff

# Prevent clickjacking
Header always set X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN

# XSS Protection
Header always set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"

# Referrer Policy
Header always set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"

# Permissions Policy (disable unnecessary features)
Header always set Permissions-Policy "geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=()"

# Content Security Policy
Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; media-src 'self'; frame-src 'none'"

# HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS)
Header always set Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload"

# ==========================================
# FILE PROTECTION
# ==========================================

# Protect .htaccess and other sensitive files
<Files ~ "^\.ht">
    Require all denied
</Files>

# Block access to source files and config
<FilesMatch "\.(map|ts|tsx|json|md|lock)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# Protect backup and temporary files
<FilesMatch "\.(bak|backup|tmp|temp|log)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# ==========================================
# DIRECTORY SECURITY
# ==========================================

# Prevent directory browsing
Options -Indexes

# Disable server signature
ServerSignature Off

# ==========================================
# PERFORMANCE & CACHING
# ==========================================

# Cache static assets
<FilesMatch "\.(css|js|png|jpg|jpeg|gif|ico|svg|woff|woff2|ttf|eot)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
    Header set Expires "Thu, 31 Dec 2025 20:00:00 GMT"
</FilesMatch>

# Cache HTML with shorter duration
<FilesMatch "\.(html|htm)$">
    Header set Cache-Control "public, max-age=3600"
</FilesMatch>

# ==========================================
# HOTLINK PROTECTION
# ==========================================

# Prevent hotlinking of images and assets
RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^$
RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https://garthpuckerin\.com [NC]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https://www\.garthpuckerin\.com [NC]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https://.*\.google\. [NC]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_REFERER} !^https://.*\.bing\. [NC]
RewriteRule \.(jpg|jpeg|png|gif|css|js|pdf)$ - [F,L]

# ==========================================
# RATE LIMITING (Basic)
# ==========================================

# Limit request size
LimitRequestBody 10485760

# ==========================================
# ERROR PAGES
# ==========================================

# Custom error pages
ErrorDocument 403 /index.html
ErrorDocument 404 /index.html
ErrorDocument 500 /index.html

# ==========================================
# COMPRESSION
# ==========================================

# Enable Gzip compression
<IfModule mod_deflate.c>
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/plain
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/html
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/xml
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/css
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/xml
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/xhtml+xml
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/rss+xml
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/javascript
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/x-javascript
    AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE application/json
</IfModule>

# ==========================================
# SPA ROUTING (React Router)
# ==========================================

# Handle client-side routing
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
RewriteRule . /index.html [L]
```

## 📋 DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST

### **1. Upload .htaccess**
- Place this file in your GoDaddy `public_html` directory
- Ensure it's named exactly `.htaccess` (with the dot)

### **2. GoDaddy SSL Configuration**
- Enable SSL certificate in GoDaddy control panel
- Force HTTPS redirects (handled by .htaccess above)

### **3. DNS Security**
- Consider using Cloudflare for additional DDoS protection
- Enable domain lock in GoDaddy

### **4. Test Security**
After deployment, test your security:
- **SSL Test**: https://www.ssllabs.com/ssltest/
- **Security Headers**: https://securityheaders.com/
- **Observatory**: https://observatory.mozilla.org/

### **5. Monitor**
- Set up Google Search Console
- Monitor for any security alerts
- Regular SSL certificate renewal (auto with Let's Encrypt)

---

**This configuration provides enterprise-level security for your static portfolio!** 🛡️